  "releaseNotes": "- Added opt-in company-scoped authorization data to User, including per-company roles, claims, session scope mode, and claim conflict detection.\n\t\t  - Added LoadCompanyScopesInfo and LoadCompanyScopesAsync while preserving the existing default user-loading behavior.\n\t\t  - Added idempotent SQL migration and audit scripts for company memberships, session scope mode, supporting indexes, and company-scope loading procedures.\n\t\t  - Updated Azure.Core, Google.Apis.Gmail.v1, StackExchange.Redis, and System.ClientModel dependencies.\n\t\t  - Added characterization tests for company-scope contracts, role and claim normalization, conflict detection, and opt-in compatibility.\n\t\t  - Nuget package update.",
